graph TD
  accTitle: Human crew, planned analytical roles and the current local approval boundary
  accDescr: Multiple human teammates coordinate a larger set of logical specialist contexts. All model and tool roles are planned, with zero verified product calls. Google would orchestrate, Iris would rank finite feasible choices, fal analysis selection is pending, and Treg supplies retrieval tools rather than model routing. Only the current human Chief may approve changed simulation scope. Built local gates do not establish real authentication or runtime integration.

  CREW["Small human crew<br/>Chief + analyst / camera teammates"]
  CHIEF["Current human Chief<br/>Reviews changed mission scope"]

  subgraph INTELLIGENCE["PLANNED logical roles"]
    direction TB
    ORCH["Main orchestrator · Google<br/>Coordinates bounded analysis"]
    SPECIALISTS["Evidence specialists<br/>Pixels · sources · relative projection"]
    FAL["fal analysis candidate<br/>Model / modality selection pending"]
    TREG["Treg retrieval tools<br/>Not a model router"]
    IRIS["Iris choice ranker<br/>Finite feasible options only"]
    ORCH --> SPECIALISTS
    FAL --> SPECIALISTS
    TREG --> SPECIALISTS
    SPECIALISTS --> IRIS
  end

  subgraph LOCAL["BUILT local gates"]
    direction TB
    PROPOSAL["Proposal validation<br/>Scope · versions · expiry"]
    APPROVAL["Current-Chief approval gate<br/>One reservation + command"]
    PROPOSAL --> APPROVAL
  end

  EXECUTOR["PLANNED · drone executors<br/>Deterministic teammate simulator"]

  CREW -. shared received picture .-> ORCH
  CREW --> CHIEF
  IRIS -. proposed choice .-> PROPOSAL
  CHIEF -. explicit human decision .-> APPROVAL
  APPROVAL -. simulation command only .-> EXECUTOR

  classDef built fill:#ffffff,stroke:#006bff,stroke-width:2px,color:#171717;
  classDef planned fill:#fafafa,stroke:#7d7d7d,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#171717;
  class PROPOSAL,APPROVAL built;
  class CREW,CHIEF,ORCH,SPECIALISTS,FAL,TREG,IRIS,EXECUTOR planned;
  style INTELLIGENCE fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c9c9c9,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  style LOCAL fill:#fafafa,stroke:#006bff
